","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究将语音的“自然度”拆解为多个语言学维度的评估框架，构建首个面向文本转语音系统的维度级元评估基准，用来检验现有自动评估模型在捕捉人类听觉感知各层面的表现。","title":"Beyond Naturalness: Probing Automated Text-To-Speech Evaluators on Linguistically Grounded Dimensions"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_8434712c7f5a40548c7a72e22f629b8aa7bf2f8498cf75f3f5afd24cf3a97a22","internal_url":"/posts/20260811-arxiv-from-values-to-benchmarks-evaluating-large-languag-0-8b89f3662a/","observation_id":"obs_8b89f3662afb029b571fbf32f91c4481194def9993c932eee578e063ae63d6a8","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:59:05Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"From Values to Benchmarks: Evaluating Large Language Models for Governmental Use in Dutch"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_83d9dbbbdc8328f28fe9ab611b19fc50dd259139c418ecd9daf6d746c605b648","internal_url":"/posts/20260811-arxiv-decoding-level-taboo-a-diagnostic-stress-test-for--0-b6ecd37137/","observation_id":"obs_b6ecd3713775f72f66cbda875304dde5a8067c201e9468f4ed480095e204c9fd","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:47:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"一种在模型解码阶段直接干预概率分布的零提示诊断测试，通过在词边界动态屏蔽主要候选标记，强迫模型产生迂回表达，从而评估其在非正常生成路径下的鲁棒性。","title":"Decoding-Level Taboo: A Diagnostic Stress Test for LLM Robustness"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_de0e4522d885d63924dc2be140b7727913ced8273787afcda7799a2d5695bbc9","internal_url":"/posts/20260811-arxiv-consilience-for-verifier-free-test-time-scaling-1-9d6480d38b/","observation_id":"obs_9d6480d38b70fa4745b01fe20b9541da984cf1a7be548180cade1fbbc31720e8","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:45:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究指出，现有的仅依赖置信度排序的免验证器测试时扩展方法在复杂任务上会失效，因为全程高置信度往往意味着探索不足。作者提出一种名为 **consilience** 的选择框架，通过评估置信度随时间的非对称性，显式惩罚初始高置信度并要求最终答案具备确定性。","title":"Consilience for Verifier-Free Test-Time Scaling"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_86d334dafc73bd2a4995c3027dbbd81cb0befb4dce19fefb64c88f44bfa798a6","internal_url":"/posts/20260812-arxiv-she-trajectory-driven-safety-harness-evolution-for-3-b3f38990d9/","observation_id":"obs_b3f38990d9b119745c4a2115d2a1100ac229bb9fb0d5f819114843904a4c2183","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:35:08Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究提出一种通过学习交互轨迹动态演进 LLM Agent 安全护栏的框架。将护栏拆分为系统提示、规则库、安全记忆和工具策略四个组件，并构建属性导向的演进循环，把轨迹失败转化为结构化诊断并在各组件上局部优化，从而在保持功能效用的同时提升安全性。","title":"SHE: Trajectory-driven Safety Harness Evolution for LLM Agents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5a251ea672e8a80f1e7f612faa1bbd4856baab52c263035633cb4f06062657e6","internal_url":"/posts/20260812-arxiv-stealing-reasoning-traces-from-proprietary-llm-api-4-a3f66794cc/","observation_id":"obs_a3f66794ccd26d9a54ab9cdcff437c26b51d66c14cf843c80567cf318c10e06c","published_at":"2026-08-10T17:24:50Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Stealing Reasoning Traces from Proprietary LLM APIs"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":63,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.477273,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":38,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.287879,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":19,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.143939,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":13,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.098485,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.090909,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:RAG","id":"tag:RAG","jaccard":0.090909,"topic":"RAG"},{"cooccurrence":11,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.083333,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":10,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.075758,"topic":"Advanced (300)